            {
                "entry_id": "aff35b13-de1a-3d50-bd0d-43876d980c37",
                "word": "spiro",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3b5db247-755f-3d24-b648-a3162c99dc3a",
                        "entry_id": "aff35b13-de1a-3d50-bd0d-43876d980c37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of spironolactone."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a0b5675-ecad-4231-9ba6-8fe94792160d",
                                "sense_id": "3b5db247-755f-3d24-b648-a3162c99dc3a",
                                "text": "I was on estradiol tablets, finasteride, micronized progesterone, and spironolactone. I had an orchiectomy and have been taken off of progesterone and spiro. As far as changes to my body, they have been very miniscule in comparison to a person half my age. The most changes have been in my face."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47f59fc1-abe2-48d0-b2a0-7f5831bd2734",
                                "sense_id": "3b5db247-755f-3d24-b648-a3162c99dc3a",
                                "text": "After trying everything short of Accutane, she finally found her magic combo of spironolactone and hormonal birth control. “Birth control and spiro were my dream duo,” she says. “They knocked out my acne, my skin was flawless, but I had to have both.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "748005ff-a22a-43d3-8574-12c3dcfaf790",
                                "sense_id": "3b5db247-755f-3d24-b648-a3162c99dc3a",
                                "text": "Important to keep in mind: It usually takes up to three months to see a difference with tretinoin. So don’t expect miracles in a matter of a few weeks. However! Because I had been using tret previously, it really was like I just added the tranexamic acid and topical spiro to my routine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3bfd8a48-6a0d-45a5-b90e-2ea34a0a05ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "aff35b13-de1a-3d50-bd0d-43876d980c37",
                        "source_sense_id": "3b5db247-755f-3d24-b648-a3162c99dc3a",
                        "source_sense_description": "spironolactone",
                        "target_lang_word": "spiro",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spiro",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "470b4f6a-e4b9-3b2e-b75d-7f523e173205",
                                        "entry_id": "9f3cccc7-ff9f-3b8d-8c31-fa3daeaeee71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médicament spironolactone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "note": "Le terme est utilisé dans les communautés trans, le spironolactone étant prescrit pour son effet anti-androgène dans les traitements hormonaux substitutifs féminins",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fef86f2-a624-4acf-bd06-1210f01e31f6",
                                                "sense_id": "470b4f6a-e4b9-3b2e-b75d-7f523e173205",
                                                "text": "J’ai supprimé la spiro parce que les injections font très bien leur travail. Les pilules (estradiol & spiro) avaient tellement d’effets secondaires et je vois que les troubles que j’avais se sont arrêté rapidement après les injections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fd3423c-2bab-4534-9ec2-64ea8e5b7a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "470b4f6a-e4b9-3b2e-b75d-7f523e173205",
                                                "text": "Un protocole Mtf peut tout à fait utiliser de la dutas [dutastéride] comme anti androgène, c’est à mon avis bien plus pertinent que l’androcur ou même la spiro."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
